In principle, but that’s not going to get you around the problem.

You need software that doesn’t try to store the full results.

If scantwo works with method=“mr”, maybe it works when you have run calc.genoprob with step=0, so just calculating things at the markers and not adding intervening pseudomarkers.

karl

